   ├─ grove
   │  ├─ bound: 1 slot (GIT_REPO_TEST_SLOTS)
   │  ├─ ⏳ 1 of 1 slot held, wait for one
   │  │  └─ slot.0: tree-holder · integration · pid <pid> · <holder-age>
   │  ├─ tip: a path --scope skips the wait (a name:// scope alone loads every file)
   │  ├─ ⏳ still held (30s)
   │  │  └─ slot.0: tree-holder · integration · pid <pid> · <holder-age>
   │  └─ 🎫 slot.0 claimed after <wait-age>"
`;

